  "id": 8859759149255,
  "title": "Personalized Floral Cross God Says Throw Blanket, Lightweight - God",
  "handle": "personalized-floral-cross-god-says-throw-blanket-lightweight-god",
  "body_html": "<p>Wrap yourself in faith and comfort with the Jeminise personalized Christian blanket, a truly unique and heartfelt gift. This inspiring blanket features uplifting Christian themes and can be customized with a name or text, making it a perfect keepsake or thoughtful present for any occasion.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Unique Christian Design:</strong> Features faith-based messages and uplifting Christian themes to provide daily encouragement and spiritual inspiration.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Meaningful Gift:</strong> A perfect personalized gift that combines faith, love, and comfort, making it an ideal keepsake for Christian women.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Customization Options:</strong> Easily add a custom name or text to create a one-of-a-kind, meaningful item.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Offered in Small (40x30 inches), Medium (50x40 inches), Large (60x50 inches), and X-Large (80x60 inches) to suit any preference.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Versatile Use:</strong> Ideal for birthdays, Christmas, Valentine's Day, New Year, or special milestones, offering spiritual encouragement.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Material Details:</strong> Made from durable Polyester fabric.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Designed for hand wash only to maintain its quality and vibrant design.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Blanket</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fill Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Design</th>\n<td>Chrsitian I Am Blanket</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Christian</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Letter Print</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Blanket Form</th>\n<td>Throw Blanket</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>1 text input</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>Small, Medium, Large, X-Large</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Dimensions</th>\n<td>60\"L x 50\"W</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Special Feature</th>\n<td>Lightweight</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>All</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Hand Wash Only</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
